From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tiaoge-tou <85100527+Tiaoge-tou@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 00:09:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Launcher settings go back to English in settings.tsv and
 nacp.py; the three new rows stay, in English

Patch 0084 translated the settings table in place, which fights this repository's localisation layering: launcher.json texts are English by design, the shells translate them by their English text through the catalogues built from frontend/l10n, and the Mac launcher's tests hold settings.tsv's labels to the launch.set entries. So the table and the NACP language names return to the pin's English, and the rows 0084 added (SS_DISPLAY_HZ, DM_SILK_SKIN, DM_HADES_SKIN) stay with English texts written for the catalogues: SS_DISPLAY_HZ is 'Refresh rate' with 60 Hz / 120 Hz options (its texts must not collide with DM_FPS_TARGET's 'Frame rate' / '60 fps', whose translations differ), the skin rows are 'Button skin' with Glass / Thorn / Moon options. The Chinese texts move to frontend/l10n, in the same change on the repository side. Launcher.swift's own Chinese strings from 0084 are untouched.

Upstream-Status: fork-only
Reason: Completes patch 0084 in this repository's localisation layering: settings texts stay English, translations live in frontend/l10n (PROJECT.md Phase 2)
Issue: Tiaoge-tou/NX2Apple PROJECT.md Phase 2

---
 dm/games/settings.tsv | 40 ++++++++++++++++++++--------------------
 dm/tools/nacp.py      |  4 ++--
 2 files changed, 22 insertions(+), 22 deletions(-)

